+  5. FORMAL RETURN_TO_CHATGPT MUST REFLECT ACTUAL FINAL STATE
+     - Prior formal body claimed merge_executed=FALSE but merge occurred
+     - Prior formal body claimed push_executed=FALSE but push occurred
+     - Prior formal body claimed amend_executed=FALSE but amend occurred
+     - Rule: Formal body must report actual final state, not planned state
